      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Chocolate-Cake-2.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mixing bowl, combine all of the ingredients together. Whisk until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-oven-baked-chocolate-cake/#wprm-recipe-54475-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Chocolate-Cake-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the cake mixture into the greased baking pan and smooth out with a spatula.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-oven-baked-chocolate-cake/#wprm-recipe-54475-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Chocolate-Cake-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven for 20-25 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the middle comes out clean.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-oven-baked-chocolate-cake/#wprm-recipe-54475-step-0-4",
