    },
    {
      "text": "Make the frosting by beating all of the ingredients with a mixer. Add more milk as needed to achieve the desired consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-oven-baked-chocolate-cake/#wprm-recipe-54475-step-0-5",
